==English==

===Etymology===
{{root|en|ine-pro|*h₂el- (other)}}
From {{inh|en|enm|ells}}, {{m|enm|elles}}, from {{inh|en|ang|elles||other, otherwise, different}}, from {{inh|en|gmw-pro|*alljas}}, from {{inh|en|gem-pro|*aljas||of another, of something else}}, genitive of {{m|gem-pro|*aljaz||other}}, from {{inh|en|ine-pro|*h₂élyos}}, from {{m|ine-pro|*h₂el-||other}}.

Cognate with {{cog|ofs|elles||other}}, {{cog|goh|elles}}, {{m|goh|ellies||other}}, {{cog|da|eller||or}}, {{cog|da|ellers||otherwise}}, {{cog|sv|eljes}}, {{m|sv|eljest||or else, otherwise}}, {{cog|no|elles||else, otherwise}}, {{cog|got|𐌰𐌻𐌾𐌹𐍃||other}}, {{cog|la|alius||other, another}}, {{cog|grc|ἄλλος}}, {{grc-ark}} {{m|grc|αἶλος}}, modern {{cog|el|αλλιώς||otherwise, else}}, {{cog|sla-pro|*olni}}.

